{"seq":3,"slug":"resilience","title":"弹性与流量管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-limiting-throttling","title":"限流与节流策略：网关如何控制请求速率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/rate-limiting-throttling","wordCount":785,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"circuit-breaking-retry","title":"熔断与重试：网关的故障隔离机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/circuit-breaking-retry","wordCount":788,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-gateway","title":"网关层缓存：减少后端压力的响应缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/caching-gateway","wordCount":736,"readingTime":3}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"弹性与流量管理\">弹性与流量管理</h1><p>本章聚焦于网关作为&quot;流量调节器&quot;的角色。三篇文档分别覆盖：速率控制策略（<a href=\"rate-limiting-throttling\">限流与节流策略</a>）、故障隔离与自愈机制（<a href=\"circuit-breaking-retry\">熔断与重试</a>）、以及减少后端压力的缓存层（<a href=\"caching-gateway\">网关层缓存</a>）。</p>\n<p>这三项能力共同构成网关的&quot;防御性工程&quot;——保护后端服务在流量异常或部分故障时仍能稳定运行。</p>\n"}